&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-ARMWdtKDIowwlyxaSOuuzEqssIf&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cfb8dvi9voxFkWxhNcmuJX50sZb&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;Kpucdjv7JoAcSZxSf7PuRl5Yscb&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusxfrenHjJKtgnorBrzgGFPb&quot;&gt;At OKX, we believe that the future will be reshaped by crypto, and ultimately contribute to every individual&#39;s freedom.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusxfrenHjJKtgnorBrzgGFPb&quot;&gt;OKX is a leading crypto exchange, and the developer of OKX Wallet, giving millions access to crypto trading and decentralized crypto applications (dApps). OKX is also a trusted brand by hundreds of large institutions seeking access to crypto markets. We are safe and reliable, backed by our Proof of Reserves.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusxfrenHjJKtgnorBrzgGFPb&quot;&gt;Across our multiple offices globally, we are united by our core principles:&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;We Before Me&lt;/em&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;Do the Right Thing&lt;/em&gt;, and&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;Get Things Done&lt;/em&gt;. These shared values drive our culture, shape our processes, and foster a friendly, rewarding, and diverse environment for every OK-er.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cfb8dvi9voxFkWxhNcmuJX50sZb&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;PNNZdiw4Yo1ZOmx8btbucw8qsLG&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-PiRwdXFmiomeQDxx0RUuDGJ1sag&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;AwkZdlAVioMuamxLKXxlBWKkghb&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YDvwdru2xoXfjwxNo04l9W8Sgqd&quot;&gt;The Senior Growth Manager will own local growth strategy and end-to-end program delivery across product go-to-market, customer growth, and priority segments, including advanced traders and VIPs.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YDvwdru2xoXfjwxNo04l9W8Sgqd&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-K375dHlX2oiNzMxWvzGlRRLjgjc&quot;&gt;This is a hands-on senior individual contributor role responsible for translating business and product priorities into coordinated growth initiatives and measurable commercial outcomes. The role will act as the key local stakeholder for global Performance Marketing and Lifecycle teams while working closely with Product, Relationship Management, Data, Marketing, and other regional and global stakeholders.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-K375dHlX2oiNzMxWvzGlRRLjgjc&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-K375dHlX2oiNzMxWvzGlRRLjgjc&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-PiRwdXFmiomeQDxx0RUuDGJ1sag&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_de10979bee5e26c5-66&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;3,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;3,0,0,0&quot;&gt;Own local product and lifecycle marketing initiatives end to end, from strategy and positioning through execution, journey optimization, and performance reporting&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;3,0,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_de10979bee5e26c5-67&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;3,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;3,1,0,0&quot;&gt;Lead product marketing and go-to-market programs for priority products, defining positioning, target segments, customer journeys, value propositions, messaging, and adoption metrics&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;3,1,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_de10979bee5e26c5-68&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;3,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;3,2,0,0&quot;&gt;Develop full-funnel lifecycle strategies for advanced traders, VIPs, high-value customers, and other priority segments, driving activation, feature adoption, retention, monetization, and lifetime value&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;3,2,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_de10979bee5e26c5-69&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;3,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;3,3,0,0&quot;&gt;Design customer lifecycle, loyalty, reward, engagement, and reactivation programs that drive long-term retention and commercial growth&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;3,3,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_de10979bee5e26c5-70&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;3,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;3,4,0,0&quot;&gt;Act as the key local stakeholder for global Product Marketing, Performance Marketing, and Lifecycle teams, translating local product priorities into campaign briefs, automated journeys, and tailored messaging&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;3,4,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_de10979bee5e26c5-71&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;3,5,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;3,5,0,0&quot;&gt;Plan and execute high-value customer events, VIP experiences, partner activations, and lifecycle engagements, managing delivery from objectives and budgets through to stakeholder coordination and retention reporting&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;3,5,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
